Description: SnapshOT Calamares installer settings and branding
 Offline installer configuration for SnapshOT: copies the live squashfs to disk
 with no network, sets up LUKS2 full-disk encryption, and applies SnapshOT
 installer branding. Overrides calamares-settings-debian.
